{
  "chapter_id": "11",
  "chapter_name": "參觀景點/導覽",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "11-001",
      "en": "How much is the entrance fee?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "entrance fee",
          "kk": "/ˈɛntrəns fiː/",
          "zh": "入場費"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "入場費是多少？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "ticket",
        "price"
      ],
      "tips": "entrance fee 是「入場費、門票費」。也可以說 admission fee 或 ticket price。很多博物館（museum）對持有效學生證的學生、65歲以上長者或特定國籍旅客提供折扣（discount）。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-002",
      "en": "Are there any guided tours available?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "guided tours",
          "kk": "/ˈɡaɪdɪd tʊrz/",
          "zh": "導覽行程"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "有提供導覽行程嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "tour",
        "guide"
      ],
      "tips": "guided tour 是「有導遊帶領的解說導覽」。相對地，self-guided tour 是「自助導覽」。許多景點提供語音導覽機（audio guide）出租，讓你自行聆聽解說。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-003",
      "en": "What time does the museum close?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "museum",
          "kk": "/mjuːˈziəm/",
          "zh": "博物館"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "博物館幾點關門？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "hours",
        "museum"
      ],
      "tips": "詢問開放時間可問：What are your opening hours?（你們的開放時間是幾點到幾點？）或 What time do you open / close?。很多景點週一休館（closed on Mondays）。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-004",
      "en": "Is photography allowed inside?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "photography",
          "kk": "/fəˈtɑɡrəfi/",
          "zh": "攝影"
        },
        {
          "word": "allowed",
          "kk": "/əˈlaʊd/",
          "zh": "允許"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "裡面可以拍照嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "photography",
        "rules"
      ],
      "tips": "allowed 是「被允許的」。Photography is not allowed here.（這裡禁止拍照。）部分博物館或藝廊允許拍照但禁止使用閃光燈（no flash），有些展覽完全禁止拍照。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-005",
      "en": "Could you take a photo of us, please?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "photo",
          "kk": "/ˈfoʊtoʊ/",
          "zh": "照片"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "可以幫我們拍照嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "photo",
        "request"
      ],
      "tips": "請路人幫忙拍照時，可以將手機遞過去並說這句話。拍完後記得說 Thank you so much!（非常感謝！）也可以問對方是否需要你幫他們拍照。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-006",
      "en": "Do you have an English audio guide?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "audio guide",
          "kk": "/ˈɔdiɔ ɡaɪd/",
          "zh": "語音導覽"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "你們有英文語音導覽嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "audio guide",
        "language"
      ],
      "tips": "audio guide（語音導覽）是配合展品編號、自行按按鈕聆聽解說的裝置。現在很多景點也提供 App 版本，可以直接下載到手機使用，非常方便。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-007",
      "en": "Is there a map of the museum I can have?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "map",
          "kk": "/mæp/",
          "zh": "地圖"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "有博物館的地圖可以拿嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "map",
        "museum"
      ],
      "tips": "大型博物館或景點通常在入口處（entrance）提供免費紙本地圖（floor plan / map），幫助訪客了解各展廳的位置。也可以掃描 QR code 取得電子版。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-008",
      "en": "This painting was created in the fifteenth century.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "painting",
          "kk": "/ˈpeɪntɪŋ/",
          "zh": "繪畫"
        },
        {
          "word": "century",
          "kk": "/ˈsɛntʃəri/",
          "zh": "世紀"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "這幅畫創作於十五世紀。",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "art",
        "history"
      ],
      "tips": "century 是「世紀」，要注意序數用法：15th century（十五世紀）。常聽到的參觀解說中，century 是很重要的詞彙，了解不同時期的藝術風格有助於欣賞作品。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-009",
      "en": "Where is the gift shop?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "gift shop",
          "kk": "/ɡɪft ʃɑp/",
          "zh": "禮品店"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "禮品店在哪裡？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "shopping",
        "souvenir"
      ],
      "tips": "gift shop（禮品店）是景點販賣紀念品（souvenir）的商店。許多博物館的出口（exit）直接通往禮品店，這是刻意的設計。紀念品冰箱貼（fridge magnet）和明信片（postcard）是最受歡迎的選購品。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-010",
      "en": "Is there a senior discount?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "senior",
          "kk": "/ˈsiːnjɚ/",
          "zh": "進階的"
        },
        {
          "word": "discount",
          "kk": "/ˈdɪskaʊnt/",
          "zh": "折扣"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "有長者優惠嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "discount",
        "senior"
      ],
      "tips": "senior 在此指「年長者、長輩」，通常指 65 歲或 60 歲以上。詢問各種折扣：student discount（學生折扣）、senior discount（長者折扣）、group discount（團體折扣）。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-011",
      "en": "Can I buy tickets online in advance?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "online",
          "kk": "/ˈɔnˌlaɪn/",
          "zh": "在線的"
        },
        {
          "word": "in advance",
          "kk": "/ɪn ədˈvæns/",
          "zh": "提早"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我可以提前在網路上買票嗎？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "ticket",
        "booking"
      ],
      "tips": "許多熱門景點（如巴黎的艾菲爾鐵塔、梵蒂岡博物館）強烈建議提前在網路上購票，不僅可以跳過長隊（skip the queue），有時也享有更優惠的價格。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-012",
      "en": "What are the highlights of this exhibition?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "highlights",
          "kk": "/ˈhaɪˌlaɪts/",
          "zh": "亮點"
        },
        {
          "word": "exhibition",
          "kk": "/ˌɛksɪˈbɪʃən/",
          "zh": "展覽"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "這個展覽的亮點是什麼？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "exhibition",
        "inquiry"
      ],
      "tips": "highlight 是「最精彩的部分、亮點」。exhibition（展覽）指特展，collection（典藏）指長期展示的作品。詢問導覽人員或服務台，可以幫你規劃參觀重點，節省時間。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-013",
      "en": "Is there a free day or free admission on any day?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "admission",
          "kk": "/ədˈmɪʃən/",
          "zh": "入場"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "有免費參觀日或任何免費入場的時段嗎？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "free",
        "admission"
      ],
      "tips": "許多世界知名博物館（如倫敦大英博物館、紐約大都會博物館）提供免費入場（free admission），但建議捐款（donation appreciated）。部分博物館在特定日期或時段免費開放。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-014",
      "en": "Could you recommend a good local tour?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "recommend",
          "kk": "/ˌrɛkəˈmɛnd/",
          "zh": "推薦"
        },
        {
          "word": "local",
          "kk": "/ˈloʊkl/",
          "zh": "當地的"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "可以推薦好的當地導覽行程嗎？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "tour",
        "recommendation"
      ],
      "tips": "local tour（當地導覽）可以讓你更深入了解一個城市或景點的文化與歷史。Airbnb Experiences 和 GetYourGuide 等平台都提供當地達人帶領的小團導覽，體驗更生動有趣。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-015",
      "en": "Where is the restroom?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "restroom",
          "kk": "/ˈrɛstˌruːm/",
          "zh": "廁所"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "洗手間在哪裡？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "sightseeing",
        "restroom",
        "navigation"
      ],
      "tips": "restroom 或 bathroom 是美式英語的「廁所、洗手間」；英式英語說 toilet 或 WC（water closet）。在公共場所詢問廁所位置是旅行中最實用的句子之一，任何地點都適用。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    }
  ],
  "quiz": {
    "multiple_choice": [
